  "contract": [
    "Only exact typed EAX=0 selects the one-index native API.",
    "ECX keeps all 32 bits; 511/512, high bits and all-ones are transported without masking.",
    "Partial AX clearing and nonzero/dynamic leaves do not select the specialized API.",
    "Unknown memory effects retain index evaluation and post-instruction memory reload.",
    "Source/native contracts reject altered types, calling convention, effects, return assumptions and unowned names.",
    "Both legacy SDK assembly and qualified LLVM native IR reach the shared C dispatch."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "VMFUNC is intercepted; no successful physical EPT switch or VM-exit/fault continuation is claimed.",
    "Controlled continuation for nonzero leaves tests transport only, not architectural fallthrough.",
    "NeverC i386 complete-source driver qualification is Linux ELF only.",
    "Other machine modes/task transitions, software SMM/SGX and unbound asynchronous providers remain outside this integration."
  ],
